      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm managing a rental property out in phoenix and one of my tenants is complaining that their AC is running constantly but one of the bedrooms is staying really warm. can u give me a list of common reasons why a single room might not be cooling properly even if the rest of the house feels fine?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
